{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of ounces of water needed to reduce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ounces of shaving lotion containing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />&#160;% alcohol to a lotion containing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />&#160;% alcohol is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8528c604f00cf30e093b00e655bd6de60ea972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Say we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> ounces of water to the shaving lotion. Since half of a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ounce bottle of shaving lotion is alcohol, we know that we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5adcd622a1ba9d557e1e14b7810cd5852e5ec05e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> ounces of alcohol. We want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f64c31b4116b24fe3c26f582732c8efd216c0909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{2}=0.3(9+N)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"121\" height=\"37\" /> (because we want the amount of alcohol, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5adcd622a1ba9d557e1e14b7810cd5852e5ec05e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37f304ca2f7b5973a2693215935adf1998071457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.3$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, of the total amount of shaving lotion, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd573ab284eaabaa814f19c489ce6ea21a034f22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />). Solving, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45cf0114195f1d2081529ea0e7225b5ea47f593.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9=0.6(9+N)\\implies9=5.4+0.6N\\implies3.6=0.6N\\implies6=N.\\]\" width=\"508\" height=\"18\" /> So, the total amount of water we need to add is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/0/2c024459b191f13b58f34b5e366d4e49e32cad7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The concentration of alcohol after adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> ounces of water is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f08948f5c99d03465777a24a01c903ba436f1e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4.5}{9+n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"44\" height=\"39\" />. \n</p><p>To get a solution of 30% alcohol, we solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dcaf7d0369332ead85270ba2f2d79cf1dfe67cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4.5}{9+n}=\\frac{3}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/5091bafd0a9fdaec4a869a674dab4098f7b0a253.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45=27+3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/12012e185ce9e74651e669b9af0a97fbb9a99a4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18=3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/a/d4a2de5dbd8a92be230a0ff3139828629c07c34c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6=n \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"150\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<